title REDS #78 — the SAFE-census wording-drift red, fixed forward
prompt Reds-first: the SAFE-census red surfaced during the REDS-fold lap (fascia_metric_v0 prints 'no live shred', the census greps 'no shred'); fix it forward, seat its ledger row, re-run the choir.
think The fold lap ran equinox_reds_choir_witness, which bundles a SAFE-list elder that went RED. Tracing the chain: choir -> safe_list_census_witness -> tools/fixtures/safe_list_census.sh sets SHRED_RED by grepping fascia_metric_v0's output for 'refuse: shred|no shred|shred refuse'. The metric now prints 'no live shred' — the inserted word 'live' breaks the 'no shred' substring — so SHRED_RED read 'no', the census verdict went thin, and the witness had been silently RED. Exactly REDS #67's shape: a witness reading another tool's prose that did not follow when that prose moved.
think Fix forward: widen the alternation to include 'no live shred' while keeping the older 'no shred' / 'shred refuse' / 'refuse: shred' phrasings, so a bench on either wording still reads the held-refuse signal, with a comment naming why (the #67 lesson). After the widen: the census reads SHRED_RED=yes, verdict=ok.
think Honest limit named: safe_list_census_witness still cannot reach full GREEN on THIS bench, because a deeper elder (tigerbeetle_golden_rule_census_witness) asserts gratitude/tigerbeetle/src is present, and that gratitude study clone is a network fetch held on the maintainer's hand — absent here. That is a provisioning fact, not a code red, and no code change of mine can or should supply it. So I fixed the genuine tree red (the wording-drift) and named the provisioning gap rather than pretending a green.
obs The census fixture is GREEN at its own level (verdict=ok, SHRED_RED=yes); the two reds witnesses stay GREEN after seating row 78 (reds-ledger verdict=ok, reds-monotone rows=78 expect_next=79 no gaps). Row 78 carries all three fields, including the honest note about the absent gratitude clone.
obs Reds-first cascade honored: the red found during the fold lap is booked and fixed before returning to the whole-suite crypto witness crux. The provisioning gap (absent tigerbeetle clone) is named, not fixed — it needs a host clone, a step outside this jailed bench.
